    <node id="&quot;ANTWAN PEEK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Antwan Peek is a talented college basketball player who made a significant impact in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league and later transitioned to professional baseball in Japan."</data>
